@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### List funds
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/funds
Accept: application/json

### Get balance
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/funds/balance
Accept: application/json

### Subscribe to a fund
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/funds/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"fundId": "1",
	"notifyChannel": "email",
	"notifyDestination": "test@example.com"
}

### Cancel a fund subscription
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/funds/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"fundId": "1"
}

### Latest transactions
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/funds/transactions?count=10
Accept: application/json

